|    BBT guide                                                                   |
|                                                                                |
|    This guide teaches you to write the screens of a Velour BBS. It             |
|    is for the artist and the screen author. You need a text editor,            |
|    a terminal and a telnet client.                                             |
|                                                                                |
|    Introduction                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|    The BBS directory                                                           |
|                                                                                |
|    A "BBS directory" holds the files of one BBS:                               |
|                                                                                |
|    File                  Content                                ...            |
|    ───────────────────────────   1/6   ────────────────────────────            |
|    Space Next                                           Esc To list            |
|                                                                                |
