|    │ go build ./cmd/velourbbs                                                  |
|                                                                                |
|    The command writes the file velourbbs (velourbbs.exe on                     |
|    Windows). Put it in a directory of your PATH. Or ask the sysop              |
|    for the program.                                                            |
|                                                                                |
|    The example                                                                 |
|                                                                                |
|    The tasks build the example BBS "Lamp". Its files are in                    |
|    examples/lamp/en/.                                                          |
|                                                                                |
|      ∙ A line with a path and a colon shows a whole file of the                |
|        example. Example: `examples/lamp/en/screens/main.bbt`:.                 |
